Package: PhysioExperiment
Title: Shared Data Model for Physiological Signal Analysis
Version: 2.3.1
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Yusuke",
           family = "Matsui",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "mail.to.matsui@gmail.com")
Description: Provides the shared data model for the Physio ecosystem: the
    PhysioExperiment class, a 'SummarizedExperiment' extension for multi-modal
    physiological signal data (such as electroencephalography, electromyography,
    and electrocardiography), together with the containers for multiple
    simultaneously recorded streams, repeated sessions of one subject, and
    cohorts of subjects. Includes core accessors, channel and event management,
    provenance, and basic 'S4' methods. Domain packages apply specialized
    methods to these shared containers and are installed separately.
biocViews: Software, Infrastructure, DataRepresentation, TimeCourse
